{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415037","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415037","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041503701:1":{"text":"편식하면 영양실조에 걸려. 건강에 안 좋아.","source_cn":"挑食会营养不良，这对你不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5552DE6448FCC76E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503702:1":{"text":"언니, 잘 모르나 본데 그레이브본은 음식을 먹을 필요가 없어.","source_cn":"姐姐，你或许不知道，亡灵不需要吃东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B0F6A799E46F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503703:1":{"text":"언니 기준에 맛있든 맛없든 내 눈에는 그냥 돌이랑 똑같아.","source_cn":"不管是你觉得好吃的还是不好吃的，在我看来都和石头一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9256A6659DC30066","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503704:1":{"text":"먹기 싫어. 하나도 맛있어 보이는 것도 없고 말이야.","source_cn":"我不想吃东西，那些东西也没一个看起来好吃的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58BF9F4AE9488A42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503705:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503706:1":{"text":"그럼 나라는 어떤 종류의 “돌”을 좋아하는데?","source_cn":"那么，你比较喜欢哪种“石头”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA57802F9E4C05A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503707:1":{"text":"이게 무슨 농담이야?!","source_cn":"你在开什么玩笑？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A52E543FBED2DF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503708:1":{"text":"네 눈에 음식이 전부 돌같다고 해도, 그중에 상대적으로 더 좋아하는 “돌”이 있을 거 아니야.","source_cn":"食物在你眼里就算都和石头一样，也有相对来说更喜欢的“石...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAC7B9E866652CF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041503709:1":{"text":"어떤 종류를 좋아해? 내가 구해다 줄게.","source_cn":"你喜欢哪种？我给你找来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9294B736907A90FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041503710:1":{"text":"내가 피와 살을 원한다면?","source_cn":"如果我想要的是血肉呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B1DF58C36604528","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041503711:1":{"text":"사람을 해치지 않고 다른 사람이 남긴 걸 가져오면 되니까.","source_cn":"不伤人，不捡别人剩下的吃就行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x468CCC6AACB019D3","varian